# Solana RPC endpoint used to read on-chain SPL supply (the "verified on-chain"
# badges). Optional — falls back to the public mainnet-beta RPC, which is
# rate-limited and unreliable under load. For a live demo, set a dedicated
# provider URL here (free tiers work):
#
#   Helius     https://mainnet.helius-rpc.com/?api-key=YOUR_KEY
#   Alchemy    https://solana-mainnet.g.alchemy.com/v2/YOUR_KEY
#   QuickNode  https://YOUR-ENDPOINT.solana-mainnet.quiknode.pro/YOUR_TOKEN/
#
# Read by both `vite dev` (via vite.config.ts) and the Vercel function
# (api/solana.ts). Copy this file to `.env` and fill in your URL.
SOLANA_RPC_URL=
